{"text":"Para de guardar ordem de serviço no papel. Uma mancha de óleo e já era. E não é só a mancha, cara. É o cliente que volta oito meses depois perguntando o que você trocou no carro dele. E você caçando a folha em três gavetas. No BoxMonitor, cada serviço fica no histórico do carro. O que foi feito, a data, a quilometragem e a nota. Abre o carro e tá tudo lá. Manda pra quem ainda tem pilha de papel no balcão.","voice":"YU8EsJtXFMyKMxYtheDk","settings":"{\"stability\":0.45,\"similarity_boost\":0.8,\"style\":0.3,\"use_speaker_boost\":true,\"speed\":1.05}","seconds":25.17,"charStarts":[0,0.116,0.279,0.337,0.372,0.418,0.441,0.476,0.522,0.557,0.592,0.639,0.697,0.778,0.859,0.882,0.94,1.01,1.068,1.115,1.173,1.196,1.242,1.265,1.3,1.358,1.405,1.486,1.579,1.66,1.776,1.834,1.858,1.881,1.916,1.95,1.985,2.02,2.113,2.194,2.287,2.403,2.519,2.717,2.798,2.891,2.937,3.019,3.088,3.181,3.228,3.286,3.344,3.379,3.448,3.483,3.529,3.669,3.785,3.866,3.913,3.982,4.098,4.238,4.319,4.389,4.47,4.551,4.667,4.725,4.865,4.946,5.143,5.224,5.317,5.364,5.422,5.457,5.515,5.55,5.619,5.666,5.782,5.805,5.828,5.909,5.956,6.072,6.118,6.177,6.223,6.258,6.281,6.304,6.374,6.513,6.56,6.676,6.734,6.873,6.943,7.012,7.036,7.059,7.117,7.187,7.221,7.256,7.303,7.349,7.372,7.419,7.442,7.465,7.488,7.558,7.605,7.721,7.779,7.848,7.93,8.022,8.162,8.22,8.278,8.313,8.371,8.406,8.499,8.522,8.545,8.58,8.649,8.684,8.777,8.835,8.916,8.963,8.998,9.056,9.091,9.16,9.195,9.23,9.276,9.323,9.381,9.462,9.497,9.567,9.59,9.613,9.636,9.752,9.799,9.845,9.892,9.961,10.019,10.101,10.159,10.194,10.263,10.31,10.368,10.426,10.495,10.53,10.553,10.6,10.635,10.67,10.716,10.751,10.797,10.832,10.879,10.902,10.96,10.995,11.111,11.157,11.273,11.355,11.587,11.668,11.738,11.773,11.831,11.9,11.935,12.005,12.051,12.167,12.249,12.33,12.376,12.423,12.446,12.469,12.492,12.574,12.643,12.806,12.864,12.899,12.922,12.957,13.003,13.026,13.096,13.166,13.235,13.305,13.328,13.375,13.41,13.491,13.549,13.665,13.746,13.862,13.955,14.071,14.269,14.338,14.396,14.4